      "message": "It would be helpful to mention \"/sys/firmware/devicetree/base\" here, just to make it clear.\n(This isn\u0027t a permission bypass, of course, just an alternative way to get to the data we want without accessing the data the kernel doesn\u0027t want us to have.)",
