      "writtenOn": "2024-01-25T15:35:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that (from the [kernel docs](https://www.kernel.org/doc/Documentation/ABI/testing/sysfs-firmware-ofw)):\n\u003e Userspace must not use the `/sys/firmware/devicetree/base` path directly, but instead should follow `/proc/device-tree` symlink. It is possible that the absolute path will change in the future, but the symlink is the stable ABI.",
      "parentUuid": "c255717d_fd5742c1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 12,
        "startChar": 63,
        "endLine": 13,
        "endChar": 40
      },
