      "writtenOn": "2024-01-24T17:48:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suspect that might be a security issue because the file might contain information that the kernel doesn\u0027t want userspace to know.\n\nTo check this theory, would you mind comparing the KASLR seed (at DT path `/chosen/kaslr-seed`, IIRC) between `/sys/firmware/device-tree` (which always contains the masked value `0`, IIRC) and /sys/firmware/fdt` (which I suspect would contain the actual value)?",
      "range": {
